      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The Chelaxian assassin is Hidden from the target of this ability\n\n---\nEffect The Chelaxian assassin makes a Strike with a dagger. If they hit and deal damage, the damaged creature is Frightened 1 (or Frightened 2 on a critical hit)."
